IIT Jodhpur offers a wide range of facilities to support student life, academic growth, and holistic development. Here’s an overview of the available facilities: ### **Hostel Facilities** - **Accommodation**: - 17 student hostels (5 girls’ and 12 boys’) located on campus. - Rooms are approximately 80 sq ft, furnished with beds, study tables, chairs, and almirahs. - Electricity, water supply, and Wi-Fi/LAN connectivity are provided. - Single- or double-occupancy rooms based on program (UG/PG/PhD) and year of residence. - Air-conditioning and optional bedding available. - **Common Areas**: - Well-ventilated rooms and dedicated common rooms (including TV rooms for recreation). - **Specialized Facilities**: - Short-term accommodation for visitors, interns, and event participants (up to 10 days). ### **Academic & Career Support** - **Training Programs**: Workshops to enhance employability and skill development. - **Placement Guidance**: Assistance with internships and placements. ### **Wellbeing & Amenities** - **Counseling Services**: Support for mental health and personal development. - **Mess/Dining Facilities**: On-campus dining options. ### **Research & Technology** - **AIOT Fab Facility**: Specialized labs for Artificial Intelligence of Things (AIOT) research and development. - **Prototyping Labs**: Advanced equipment for hardware development, 3D printing, and electronics testing. These facilities aim to create a safe, inclusive, and academically enriching environment for students.

